    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most offensive game ever, take your feelings and SHOVE THEM UP YOUR ASS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Trump and the other 14 playable Skull Stomper characters!  Which some are unlocked by beating levels. <br> Each playable character has unique stats!! <br>40+ lines of dialogue a piece!<br>7 unique worlds!<br>2 BOSSES!<br>A SpeedRunners dream!<br>Race against Eagle to beat your previous best times!<br>Approximately 3 hours of gameplay! <br><br>Man this game must be a million dollars?!<br>WAIT -- WHAT DO YOU MEAN IT'S FREE?!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most offensive game ever, take your feelings and SHOVE THEM UP YOUR ASS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Trump and the other 14 playable Skull Stomper characters!  Which some are unlocked by beating levels. <br> Each playable character has unique stats!! <br>40+ lines of dialogue a piece!<br>7 unique worlds!<br>2 BOSSES!<br>A SpeedRunners dream!<br>Race against Eagle to beat your previous best times!<br>Approximately 3 hours of gameplay! <br><br>Man this game must be a million dollars?!<br>WAIT -- WHAT DO YOU MEAN IT'S FREE?!</p>",
